WEBVTT

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:10.940
Lyria...

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.280
Orchis...

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.990
You inhuman beings, become my nourishment!

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.010
Gran!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.310
Come out, Celeste!

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:57.570
I shall now transcend the constraints of life.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.490
Behold, I am the one who shall reign
over the skies eternally.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.580
I am the ultimate being.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:11.670
I forgive you, you who stole
my immortality from me...

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.710
Offer up your souls!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.840
Become my nourishment, forever...

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.090
Somebody save us!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.430
Over here! Hurry!

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.780
Someone is controlling Celeste from within.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:46.490
He's sucking in the villagers' souls,
and using them as his power source.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.500
He's still got Lyria and Orchis inside there, too.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.710
That's what we're up against, is it?

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.630
But he doesn't have complete
control over Celeste.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:04.220
He seemed to have trouble absorbing me since,
unlike the villagers, I was swallowed alive.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.720
And I was saved by...

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.850
By Celeste?
By the primal beast herself?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:14.900
Our attacks are about as effective
as mosquito bites.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:19.650
We'll need some of the empire's latest firepower
to make a dent in that thing!

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:24.660
Heh, we're just hired hands,
so that's a tall order.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.240
Gran...

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:32.660
She's there.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.500
Lyria is in there.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.390
We'll find a way to stall Celeste.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:51.720
In the meantime, I'll go inside her
and rescue Lyria and the others.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.230
And free Celeste while I'm at it!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:05:00.770
The only way to prevent your souls from
being stolen is to release Celeste.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:05.200
But if that happens, this village...

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.290
Time to say goodbye, isn't it?

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:17.290
Well, by rights, we shouldn't even
be living like this in the first place.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:22.050
We were robbed of our memories, our names,
everything but our lives. Who wants that?

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:25.220
We just want to rest with dignity, that's all.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.480
I'll protect everyone in the village.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.940
Can I leave Celeste to you?

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:41.690
Just leave it to Gran and the gang.
You've got nothing to worry about!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.320
I bet we can get your memory back, too.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.320
Thanks.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.330
Celeste is just ahead!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.380
I'm counting on you, Gran.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.800
We're charging straight ahead! Are you ready?

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:16.770
Fire!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:29.280
All right. Let's see who's got
more wind in their sails!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:56.640
Gran!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:06.940
Drang...

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.960
Sturm!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.880
Pull me up!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.180
Can't hold her back for long...

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.260
She'll reach the village
before Gran does his thing.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.600
You better give it your all, Captain.

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.900
My... house?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:53.450
Is this what Io meant
by stealing scenes from our memories?

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:54.990
Is this Celeste's influence?

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.160
<i>Hey, Gran!</i>

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:59.080
<i>Is it true you got a letter from your dad?</i>

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.160
<i>Yeah, it's true!</i>

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.080
<i>That's great that he's all right.</i>

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:07.380
<i>I mean, you looked so lonely, all by yourself.</i>

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.260
<i>I'm not lonely at all!</i>

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.470
<i>I've got Vyrn, and that's enough for me!</i>

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.880
<i>You always gotta act tough, don't ya, bud?</i>

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:17.010
<i>So what did he say?
Is he coming home soon?</i>

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:21.350
<i>Oh... He didn't mention anything like that...</i>

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.230
<i>Don't freak out, okay?</i>

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.480
<i>Right now, my dad's on Estalucia,
the Island of the Astrals.</i>

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.910
<i>You worry too much, Gran.</i>

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:40.620
<i>But, even if I do make it to
the Island of the Astrals and see him...</i>

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.040
<i>What if he says he doesn't want me?</i>

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:48.500
<i>Never gonna happen! You're more important
to him than anything else!</i>

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.130
<i>Then why did he leave me behind?</i>

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.180
<i>Why won't he tell me anything?</i>

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:57.800
<i>He's waiting for me on the Island of Astrals,
so he's not coming to get me?</i>

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:02.680
<i>Well, I bet the old man has his reasons...</i>

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.270
<i>Like what? I don't understand!</i>

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:24.040
<i>I can see my dad if I go
to the Island of Astrals, right?</i>

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.620
<i>Yeah, I know you can do it, Gran.</i>

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.590
<i>After all, you're the old man's son!</i>

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.090
<i>That's true, I am...</i>

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.380
<i>That's why Dad sent me that letter, right?</i>

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:37.340
<i>Yeah! He's got faith that you're gonna
catch up to him, for sure!</i>

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:42.010
<i>So you've got to become a skyfarer like him!</i>

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:43.140
<i>Right!</i>

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.520
And so...

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.520
I became a skyfarer, just like I wanted.

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:56.820
A great skyfarer,
the kind that Dad would be proud of.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:08.500
She's resisting!

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.670
I'm aware!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:15.880
Gran...

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.380
I'm not lonely at all!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.760
Even if I don't have Dad or Mom by my side...

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:30.400
It's not like they wanted to leave me!
Because Dad needs me!

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:32.310
Shut up!

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.360
I'm gonna become a skyfarer.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.490
The greatest skyfarer of all, just like Dad!

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:40.110
But I won't abandon anyone.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:44.290
I'll help everyone, no matter what they need.
No matter what it costs me.

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:46.500
Because that's what
the greatest skyfarer would do.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.710
I've got to become the greatest skyfarer.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.130
Dad needs me. He's waiting for me.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.500
S-Stop it...

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.670
He'll see what I'm worth!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.060
It's not just about that now...

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.350
Not... anymore!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.900
It doesn't matter what's in my way,
I'll get rid of it!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.150
I'm going to the Island of Astrals!

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.870
We can't hang on any longer!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.720
<i>The end. The end of the sky.</i>

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.130
<i>At last I've reached it.</i>

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:46.970
<i>My dear child, I await you on Estalucia,
the Island of the Astrals.</i>

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.410
I'm not alone anymore.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:17.800
We might have suffered in the past...
We were in such pain...

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.130
But we won't give up.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:25.510
We'll keep moving forward, with hope
for the future! That won't change!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:33.350
We'll make it to
the Island of the Astrals, with Lyria!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.570
You mean that girl?

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.780
Surely you do not require such a being.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:54.330
A vessel who holds immense amounts of Astral power,
the very essence that makes up the skies!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:59.340
I do not know who created her
or for what purpose...

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:04.430
But she cannot be bestowed
upon ordinary mortals, ignorant of her worth!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.760
It is I who has become the ultimate being!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.850
I have transcended the stars
and broken free from the shackles of time!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.900
Immortal life, ultimate power...

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:20.610
You may have gotten what you wanted,
but you abandoned yourself to do it!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.360
Lyria won't be defeated by someone like you!

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.450
Wake up, Lyria!

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:36.250
I'm going to continue my travels.
I'm going to the end of the sky with you!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.460
I'll promise you as many times
as it takes! Because, on that day...

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.090
You gave me something!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.840
Something even more precious than my life!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:03.900
Gran!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:05.400
Lyria!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.170
Choosing to look toward the future
and moving forward...

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:26.760
You can't win against all of these lives.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.470
That includes this life,
which has hope for the future.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:42.820
And hope for you, too.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.700
O blackened sails, unfurl thy willful soul...

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.500
And drive back the false mist!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.290
Thy name is... Celeste!

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:13.550
Look!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:19.480
No... No...

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.650
I don't want to die.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:26.110
I don't want to die! I don't want to die!

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.570
I just have to take your power, directly...

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:42.540
Wh-Why? Why can't I take it?

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.840
Does this mean that I don't have the right to?

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:48.710
Why...

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:52.720
The power of the Astrals,
the essence of the skies...

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:56.180
What are... you?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.970
It's the end for us.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.230
Now, at last, we can go back
to where we belong.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.530
Celeste wanted to return this.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:23.850
Ferry?

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.020
What's the matter?

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:42.620
<i>Why? Where did I go wrong?</i>

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.830
<i>Only the sacrificial victims
were supposed to die!</i>

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.630
<i>Why did I...</i>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:53.210
<i>Why would someone like you
have the power of immortality...</i>

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.210
<i>Dad! Dad!</i>

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:57.090
<i>I won't acknowledge it...
I won't forgive you...</i>

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:05.560
<i>I shall obtain eternal life and get my revenge,
if it's the last thing I do!</i>

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:23.330
<i>Dad!</i>

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.120
<i>With the last of my life...</i>

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.130
<i>Please grant me...</i>

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.760
<i>The power to protect you...</i>

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.140
<i>How are you feeling?</i>

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.100
<i>I'm sure that you'll get better soon,
and come back to the island.</i>

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:49.730
<i>I'm protecting the treasure
with all my might, so don't worry.</i>

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:59.860
<i>I don't want to leave the island, Sister.</i>

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.620
<i>But you're going so you can be cured.</i>

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.870
<i>Don't worry, you'll get better
and be back in no time.</i>

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:12.290
<i>We'll always be together,
even if we're apart.</i>

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:18.010
<i>I'm going to get better,
and return as soon as I can, Ferry!</i>

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:37.110
<i>The sky that you can see from here
is the most beautiful on the island.</i>

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.440
We'll get to see her again, I'm sure!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:18.650
But the next time we meet,
depending on the circumstances...

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:21.400
Yeah...

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:28.040
Someday, at the end of the sky,
do you think we'll find out?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:31.910
About Orchis, about myself...

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.960
And about your father?

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.130
I have to believe that we will.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.380
All right, why don't you give it up now?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:46.640
What do you mean? The shops I frequent?
The color of my pajamas?

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.310
My bathing habits?

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:55.650
To be honest, I'm actually
a hard-core nana's boy, you know.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:00.360
Grandma hails from a tiny island,
and was always frail as a child,

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:06.910
so she had to live apart from her family
on a bigger island to get treatment.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:11.200
And while she was away,
her home island became shrouded in mist.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:15.460
After that, Nana always worried about
the sister she was so far apart from.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:17.500
Right up until she passed away.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.920
I made Nana a promise. To save her.

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:10.410
The Grandcypher, that crew's airship,
has entered the skyway leading to Golonzo.

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.080
For the purpose of repairing the ship, we assume.

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:18.290
First Albion, and now they've cleared
the mists of Tramont, eh?

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:20.170
Fine.

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:23.460
The project shall proceed to Phase 3.

00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:27.130
We will request the cooperation
of Amalthea's Fourth Fleet.

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.130
And also, activate the abandoned ship.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
EPISODE 9
THE TOWN OF PROMISES

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:38.960
Next episode, "The Town of Promises."
